WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.669
-In honor of Veterans Day,
we partnered

00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:04.971
with our friends at T-Mobile
and filled our entire audience

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:06.773
with veterans
and their families.

00:00:06.773 --> 00:00:08.308
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:12.411
And here at "The Tonight Show,"
we like to play a lot of games,

00:00:12.411 --> 00:00:15.147
and tonight, I want to play
a game with you guys.

00:00:15.147 --> 00:00:17.950
It's time for
the "Whisper Challenge."

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:21.220
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:23.489
-Whisper Challenge.

00:00:23.489 --> 00:00:26.725
-Now, before we start,
I need someone to play with.

00:00:26.725 --> 00:00:28.761
So, everyone, look at
your seat number right there,

00:00:28.761 --> 00:00:30.363
and if I call your number,

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:32.565
I want you to stand up
and come on down here.

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:33.733
You ready for this?

00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:35.235
Drumroll, please.
Here we go.

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:40.773
[ Drumroll ]

00:00:40.773 --> 00:00:42.408
Who wants me
to pick their number?!

00:00:42.408 --> 00:00:47.513
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:47.513 --> 00:00:50.583
Number 418.
4-1-8.

00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:53.586
♪♪

00:00:53.586 --> 00:00:57.323
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:57.323 --> 00:01:00.526
4-1-8.

00:01:00.526 --> 00:01:03.963
